   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Idempotency key per request\n\u2022 Double-entry: debits = credits\n\u2022 Outbox: DB write + event atomically\n\u2022 Retries with backoff, never double charge\n\u2022 Reconcile and alert on mismatches",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Idempotency key per request\n\u2022 Double-entry: debits = credits\n\u2022 Outbox: DB write + event atomically\n\u2022 Retries with backoff, never double charge\n\u2022 Reconcile and alert on mismatches",
   "fontSize": 16,
